---
description: Require feature branches and pull requests for every change
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository workflow in `AGENTS.md`.

- Never push directly to `main`; all changes must go through a pull request.
- "Commit and push" means push a feature branch and open a PR targeting `main`.
- Verify the branch and explicit destination before pushing. For example:
  `git push -u origin feat/my-change`.
- Never interpret a generic push request as permission to push to `main`.
